  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEM018N Strengthening Community Capacity (implementation)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 3-year program will train two core groups 1) civil society activists and 2) decision makers. The aim of the program is to bring both groups together so decision makers can work better on the needs of the civil society. Another aim of the program is to advocate for the activist group first at the national level and second at the global level.</narrative>
  </description>
